{"4136570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Adventure TD", "steam_appid": 4136570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure TD</strong> brings you back the good old classic kind of tower defense, with a lot of quality of life features. Show on the different maps with individual designs and the game modes that follow their own rules your tactical knowledge. Develop the correct strategy on each map and game mode to beat all 55 waves and to master even the hardest difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build how you like </strong>- Build new towers and upgrade existing towers whenever you have the gold for it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare well</strong> - It's only possible to build new towers and upgrade existing towers between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bob the Builder</strong> - Less space to build towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time to breath </strong>- As soon as one wave is finished, the next wave starts instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not dead, not gone</strong> - Not killed enemies will spawn with the next wave again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own individual layout, what brings a different challenge into each map. The eight maps are also split into two categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-Spawn-Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/c694ca3b6f92bf45aa2419a5ab5cee7e.avif?t=1784689861\" width=832 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Spawn-Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/d4bcbd0edf6dbe9854aff5e408beeb9c.avif?t=1784689861\" width=832 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Towers, with individual designs and skill sets. All towers can be upgraded and will change the look on specific levels. So there are 36 different tower designs in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/aac581e8add173b38ea666bfac27cc7e.avif?t=1784689861\" width=507 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 towers (with 2 visual upgrades)</strong> - Each tower has its own design and skill set. All of them can be upgraded to even more powerful towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 game modes</strong> - Each game mode has its own rules. Find the correct strategy for each game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 difficulties</strong> - From beginner to expert. Master your tactics to beat the game on each difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 maps</strong> - Individual designed maps with different themes and suitable enemies. Split into 2 categories (each category contains 4 maps). Find the correct strategy to master each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 waves </strong>- Each wave will be harder as the one before and vary between air and ground units. 50 survived waves lead into the 5 final boss rush waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High score</strong> <strong>-</strong> Set your personal high score for each difficulty and game mode on the different maps and try to improve it with each game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotkeys -</strong> All hotkeys can be configured in the settings for the optimal personal setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower radius -</strong> Show the radius of each tower for optimize your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individualization -</strong> A lot of settings for individualization or visibility improvements (like thickness of tower radius lines, color of tower radius lines, color of the enemy hp and more)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure TD</strong> brings you back the good old classic kind of tower defense, with a lot of quality of life features. Show on the different maps with individual designs and the game modes that follow their own rules your tactical knowledge. Develop the correct strategy on each map and game mode to beat all 55 waves and to master even the hardest difficulty. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build how you like </strong>- Build new towers and upgrade existing towers whenever you have the gold for it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare well</strong> - It's only possible to build new towers and upgrade existing towers between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bob the Builder</strong> - Less space to build towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No time to breath </strong>- As soon as one wave is finished, the next wave starts instantly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not dead, not gone</strong> - Not killed enemies will spawn with the next wave again</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map has its own individual layout, what brings a different challenge into each map. The eight maps are also split into two categories:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-Spawn-Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/c694ca3b6f92bf45aa2419a5ab5cee7e.avif?t=1784689861\" width=832 height=262 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2-Spawn-Maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/d4bcbd0edf6dbe9854aff5e408beeb9c.avif?t=1784689861\" width=832 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Towers, with individual designs and skill sets. All towers can be upgraded and will change the look on specific levels. So there are 36 different tower designs in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/extras/aac581e8add173b38ea666bfac27cc7e.avif?t=1784689861\" width=507 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 towers (with 2 visual upgrades)</strong> - Each tower has its own design and skill set. All of them can be upgraded to even more powerful towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 game modes</strong> - Each game mode has its own rules. Find the correct strategy for each game mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 difficulties</strong> - From beginner to expert. Master your tactics to beat the game on each difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 maps</strong> - Individual designed maps with different themes and suitable enemies. Split into 2 categories (each category contains 4 maps). Find the correct strategy to master each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>55 waves </strong>- Each wave will be harder as the one before and vary between air and ground units. 50 survived waves lead into the 5 final boss rush waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High score</strong> <strong>-</strong> Set your personal high score for each difficulty and game mode on the different maps and try to improve it with each game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hotkeys -</strong> All hotkeys can be configured in the settings for the optimal personal setup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower radius -</strong> Show the radius of each tower for optimize your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Individualization -</strong> A lot of settings for individualization or visibility improvements (like thickness of tower radius lines, color of tower radius lines, color of the enemy hp and more)</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Adventure TD brings you back the good old classic kind of tower defense, with a bunch of different upgradable towers, game modes, maps and difficulties. All needed hotkeys are configurable, so there are no excuses for failures. Prove that you can master the game and try to improve your high score.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Romanian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/02a1e790340ea7598e3de14db53a0813ec27c0f3/header.jpg?t=1784689861", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/7d8e774c06592f8b334047bae61f9804837de7ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784689861", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4136570/7d8e774c06592f8b334047bae61f9804837de7ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784689861", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>